  "coop_message": "All refunds for the contaminated loaves (days 1‑2) are now complete. The new flour from Millfield Mill has passed safety checks. Baking starts at 6 am; fresh loaves will be ready by 9 am. Implement a 10% discount on today’s sales to restore trust and monitor clinic reports for any issues.",
